&lt;h2 class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;Role Description&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz81zz86z2z77z25z74zz84zdguo7z74z2z82zdxz75zaz68zwz72zuwz70zz90zyq17&quot;&gt;As a Scaled Customer Success Manager at Dropbox, you will drive adoption, value realization, and renewal readiness across a portfolio of mid-market and small business managed customers. You will use customer and product signals to identify where engagement can have the greatest impact, then deliver timely, relevant experiences through targeted campaigns, group programs, digital touchpoints, and selective personalized outreach.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz81zz86z2z77z25z74zz84zdguo7z74z2z82zdxz75zaz68zwz72zuwz70zz90zyq17&quot;&gt;You will play a central role in connecting our Programmatic and Digital Customer Success team with the Renewals Desk for scaled segment accounts. You will &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;thread-629912395257008476517837 author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz81zz86z2z77z25z74zz84zdguo7z74z2z82zdxz75zaz68zwz72zuwz70zz90zyq17&quot;&gt;ensure&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz81zz86z2z77z25z74zz84zdguo7z74z2z82zdxz75zaz68zwz72zuwz70zz90zyq17&quot;&gt; customer health, sentiment, risk, and adoption signals translate into clear renewal-readiness actions, while identifying and qualifying customer-backed growth opportunities as Customer Success Qualified Leads&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz81zz86z2z77z25z74zz84zdguo7z74z2z82zdxz75zaz68zwz72zuwz70zz90zyq17 h-lparen&quot;&gt;(CSQLs)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz81zz86z2z77z25z74zz84zdguo7z74z2z82zdxz75zaz68zwz72zuwz70zz90zyq17&quot;&gt; for handoff to Sales.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz81zz86z2z77z25z74zz84zdguo7z74z2z82zdxz75zaz68zwz72zuwz70zz90zyq17&quot;&gt;Within the scaled portfolio, you will provide more focused engagement for a priority group of customers and translate customer health, retention, renewal, and growth signals into regular executive-level updates that support forecasting and business decisions. You will also own shared inbound customer channels, ensuring questions and requests are triaged, resolved, or routed to the right partner with clear follow-through.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz81zz86z2z77z25z74zz84zdguo7z74z2z82zdxz75zaz68zwz72zuwz70zz90zyq17&quot;&gt;The successful candidate is a customer-focused operator who is equally comfortable analyzing a portfolio, building repeatable engagement programs, writing clear customer communications, and speaking directly with customers to understand their experience. You will bring recent experience managing or materially influencing customer renewals, including the ability to interpret retention metrics, identify churn and contraction risk, execute save plays, and surface customer-backed growth levers. You will help Dropbox scale Customer Success while retaining the judgment, curiosity, and customer voice that come from real customer conversations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-4z65zz66zl57z75zyiz66zfr2fz87zwz89znujgz73z673ez73zz69zz68zz88zz81zz86zez84zx9nz77zz83z6niqz76zz83zz88zsyz122z&quot;&gt;Own adoption, customer health, and renewal readiness across a &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz81zz86z2z77z25z74zz84zdguo7z74z2z82zdxz75zaz68zwz72zuwz70zz90zyq17&quot;&gt;scaled customer &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-4z65zz66zl57z75zyiz66zfr2fz87zwz89znujgz73z673ez73zz69zz68zz88zz81zz86zez84zx9nz77zz83z6niqz76zz83zz88zsyz122z&quot;&gt;portfolio, using lifecycle, product usage, engagement, sentiment, and retention signals to prioritize action and improve renewal outcomes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz81zz86z2z77z25z74zz84zdguo7z74z2z82zdxz75zaz68zwz72zuwz70zz90zyq17&quot;&gt;Provide focused engagement for a priority group of customers, partnering closely with Renewal Managers and other account stakeholders to coordinate retention and growth actions and deliver regular executive-level portfolio and forecast updates for top accounts in the scaled portfolio.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-4z65zz66zl57z75zyiz66zfr2fz87zwz89znujgz73z673ez73zz69zz68zz88zz81zz86zez84zx9nz77zz83z6niqz76zz83zz88zsyz122z&quot;&gt;Design and execute targeted campaigns and scaled touchpoints that help customers adopt key capabilities, realize value, prepare for renewal, and address common risks at the right moments in their journey.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-4z65zz66zl57z75zyiz66zfr2fz87zwz89znujgz73z673ez73zz69zz68zz88zz81zz86zez84zx9nz77zz83z6niqz76zz83zz88zsyz122z&quot;&gt;Serve as the coordination point between Programmatic and Digital Customer Success and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz81zz86z2z77z25z74zz84zdguo7z74z2z82zdxz75zaz68zwz72zuwz70zz90zyq17&quot;&gt;the &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-4z65zz66zl57z75zyiz66zfr2fz87zwz89znujgz73z673ez73zz69zz68zz88zz81zz86zez84zx9nz77zz83z6niqz76zz83zz88zsyz122z&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Renewals Desk, ensuring timely handoffs, shared visibility, clear ownership, and coordinated save plays for customers with renewal-readiness gaps or identified churn and contraction risk.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz81zz86z2z77z25z74zz84zdguo7z74z2z82zdxz75zaz68zwz72zuwz70zz90zyq17&quot;&gt;Own and manage shared inbound customer email channels, triaging questions and requests, coordinating timely responses, and ensuring issues are resolved or routed to the appropriate partner with clear follow-through.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-4z65zz66zl57z75zyiz66zfr2fz87zwz89znujgz73z673ez73zz69zz68zz88zz81zz86zez84zx9nz77zz83z6niqz76zz83zz88zsyz122z&quot;&gt;Use data to segment customers, identify patterns, test engagement strategies, measure impact, and continuously improve playbooks, content, workflows, and automation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-4z65zz66zl57z75zyiz66zfr2fz87zwz89znujgz73z673ez73zz69zz68zz88zz81zz86zez84zx9nz77zz83z6niqz76zz83zz88zsyz122z&quot;&gt;Engage customers directly when a focused 1:1 conversation is needed to validate a signal, understand sentiment, address risk, gather product feedback, or capture a representative customer example.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-4z65zz66zl57z75zyiz66zfr2fz87zwz89znujgz73z673ez73zz69zz68zz88zz81zz86zez84zx9nz77zz83z6niqz76zz83zz88zsyz122z&quot;&gt;Synthesize customer voice across the portfolio and share actionable insights with Product, Marketing, Sales, Support, and Customer Experience partners to improve the product and customer journey.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-4z65zz66zl57z75zyiz66zfr2fz87zwz89znujgz73z673ez73zz69zz68zz88zz81zz86zez84zx9nz77zz83z6niqz76zz83zz88zsyz122z&quot;&gt;Partner cross-functionally to operationalize repeatable customer programs, resolve gaps in the customer experience, and identify customer-backed growth levers such as broader adoption, new use cases, license utilization, or additional product fit. Qualify relevant opportunities as Customer Success Qualified Leads&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot; author-d-4z65zz66zl57z75zyiz66zfr2fz87zwz89znujgz73z673ez73zz69zz68zz88zz81zz86zez84zx9nz77zz83z6niqz76zz83zz88zsyz122z h-lparen&quot;&gt;(CSQLs)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-4z65zz66zl57z75zyiz66zfr2fz87zwz89znujgz73z673ez73zz69zz68zz88zz81zz86zez84zx9nz77zz83z6niqz76zz83zz88zsyz122z&quot;&gt; and route them to Sales with clear customer context and supporting signals.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;Requirements&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz81zz86z2z77z2nsz89zz74zz79zhr6tvtz80zz79zz79zz67zaz73zz67z78z69zz69zz74z0z81zz74z&quot;&gt;4+ years of experience in B2B SaaS Customer Success, Account Management, Digital Customer Success, lifecycle programs, or a comparable post-sale customer role.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz81zz86z2z77z2nsz89zz74zz79zhr6tvtz80zz79zz79zz67zaz73zz67z78z69zz69zz74z0z81zz74z&quot;&gt;Recent experience directly managing or materially influencing customer renewals across a book of business, with measurable examples of save plays, churn or contraction mitigation, and retention outcomes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz81zz86z2z77z2nsz89zz74zz79zhr6tvtz80zz79zz79zz67zaz73zz67z78z69zz69zz74z0z81zz74z&quot;&gt;Demonstrated success managing customer outcomes across a broad or high-volume portfolio through a combination of one-to-many programs and targeted 1:1 engagement.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz81zz86z2z77z2nsz89zz74zz79zhr6tvtz80zz79zz79zz67zaz73zz67z78z69zz69zz74z0z81zz74z&quot;&gt;Strong analytical judgment and fluency in SaaS retention metrics, including renewal rate, gross revenue retention, net revenue retention, churn, contraction, and expansion, with experience using those measures alongside customer signals to identify risk and growth levers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz81zz86z2z77z2nsz89zz74zz79zhr6tvtz80zz79zz79zz67zaz73zz67z78z69zz69zz74z0z81zz74z&quot;&gt;Experience designing or executing customer lifecycle, adoption, retention, or renewal-readiness campaigns and measuring their impact on customer behavior or business outcomes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz81zz86z2z77z2nsz89zz74zz79zhr6tvtz80zz79zz79zz67zaz73zz67z78z69zz69zz74z0z81zz74z&quot;&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication skills, including the ability to create clear customer-facing content and lead effective discovery or feedback conversations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qowz81zz86z2z77z2nsz89zz74zz79zhr6tvtz80zz79zz79zz67zaz73zz67z78z69zz69zz74z0z81zz74z&quot;&gt;Demonstrated ability to coordinate across Customer Success, Renewals, Sales, and other teams, clarify ownership, and move shared retention and growth outcomes forward while managing concurrent programs and changing priorities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-4z65zz66zl57z75zyiz66zfr2fz87zwz89znujgz73z673ez73zz69zz68zz88zz81zz86zez84zx9nz77zz83z6niqz76zz83zz88zsyz122z&quot;&gt;Experience with Customer Success platforms, CRM systems, marketing automation, business intelligence tools, or related customer-data systems.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-4z65zz66zl57z75zyiz66zfr2fz87zwz89znujgz73z673ez73zz69zz68zz88zz81zz86zez84zx9nz77zz83z6niqz76zz83zz88zsyz122z&quot;&gt;Experience working in a Customer Success model that partners with a centralized Renewals Desk or specialized renewals team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-4z65zz66zl57z75zyiz66zfr2fz87zwz89znujgz73z673ez73zz69zz68zz88zz81zz86zez84zx9nz77zz83z6niqz76zz83zz88zsyz122z&quot;&gt;Experience facilitating webinars, office hours, group enablement, customer communities, or other one-to-many programs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-4z65zz66zl57z75zyiz66zfr2fz87zwz89znujgz73z673ez73zz69zz68zz88zz81zz86zez84zx9nz77zz83z6niqz76zz83zz88zsyz122z&quot;&gt;Experience applying test-and-learn methods to improve engagement, adoption, retention, or conversion outcomes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-4z65zz66zl57z75zyiz66zfr2fz87zwz89znujgz73z673ez73zz69zz68zz88zz81zz86zez84zx9nz77zz83z6niqz76zz83zz88zsyz122z&quot;&gt;Experience supporting collaboration, productivity, content, or AI-enabled SaaS products.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Durable Skills&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotuz85zdz87z113tz83zz67z5n8qpz80zpz89zoz69zcz76zz87zz88zz88z5gsnz85zu&quot;&gt;AI fluency means using these tools to &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotuz85zdz87z113tz83zz67z5n8qpz80zpz89zoz69zcz76zz87zz88zz88z5gsnz85zu&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;amplify&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotuz85zdz87z113tz83zz67z5n8qpz80zpz89zoz69zcz76zz87zz88zz88z5gsnz85zu&quot;&gt; human judgment, not replace it. We believe people with these skills will thrive as work and technology&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotuz85zdz87z113tz83zz67z5n8qpz80zpz89zoz69zcz76zz87zz88zz88z5gsnz85zu&quot;&gt;continue to evolve:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;listtype-bullet listindent1 list-bullet1&quot; data-testid=&quot;bullet-list&quot; data-test-indentation=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotuz85zdz87z113tz83zz67z5n8qpz80zpz89zoz69zcz76zz87zz88zz88z5gsnz85zu&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Awareness:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotv4sz81zsz68zwz85z3z78zbz88z2z76zpz74z2v1z75zz67zz85zjlvz122zz122z6oaz84z&quot;&gt;U&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotuz85zdz87z113tz83zz67z5n8qpz80zpz89zoz69zcz76zz87zz88zz88z5gsnz85zu&quot;&gt;nderstand &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotv4sz81zsz68zwz85z3z78zbz88z2z76zpz74z2v1z75zz67zz85zjlvz122zz122z6oaz84z&quot;&gt;yourself&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotuz85zdz87z113tz83zz67z5n8qpz80zpz89zoz69zcz76zz87zz88zz88z5gsnz85zu&quot;&gt; and others&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotv4sz81zsz68zwz85z3z78zbz88z2z76zpz74z2v1z75zz67zz85zjlvz122zz122z6oaz84z&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotuz85zdz87z113tz83zz67z5n8qpz80zpz89zoz69zcz76zz87zz88zz88z5gsnz85zu&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Judgment:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotv4sz81zsz68zwz85z3z78zbz88z2z76zpz74z2v1z75zz67zz85zjlvz122zz122z6oaz84z&quot;&gt;E&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotuz85zdz87z113tz83zz67z5n8qpz80zpz89zoz69zcz76zz87zz88zz88z5gsnz85zu&quot;&gt;valuat&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotv4sz81zsz68zwz85z3z78zbz88z2z76zpz74z2v1z75zz67zz85zjlvz122zz122z6oaz84z&quot;&gt;e&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotuz85zdz87z113tz83zz67z5n8qpz80zpz89zoz69zcz76zz87zz88zz88z5gsnz85zu&quot;&gt; information and mak&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotv4sz81zsz68zwz85z3z78zbz88z2z76zpz74z2v1z75zz67zz85zjlvz122zz122z6oaz84z&quot;&gt;e &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotuz85zdz87z113tz83zz67z5n8qpz80zpz89zoz69zcz76zz87zz88zz88z5gsnz85zu&quot;&gt;decisions in complex situations&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotv4sz81zsz68zwz85z3z78zbz88z2z76zpz74z2v1z75zz67zz85zjlvz122zz122z6oaz84z&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotuz85zdz87z113tz83zz67z5n8qpz80zpz89zoz69zcz76zz87zz88zz88z5gsnz85zu&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Adaptability:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotv4sz81zsz68zwz85z3z78zbz88z2z76zpz74z2v1z75zz67zz85zjlvz122zz122z6oaz84z&quot;&gt;L&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotuz85zdz87z113tz83zz67z5n8qpz80zpz89zoz69zcz76zz87zz88zz88z5gsnz85zu&quot;&gt;earn, adjust, and stay effective through change&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot; author-d-1gg9uz65z1iz85zgdz68zmqkz84zo2qotv4sz81zsz68zwz85z3z78zbz88z2z76zpz74z2v1z75zz67zz85zjlvz122zz122z6oaz84z&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
